EMPLOYEE (
    _ CC _,
    NAME,
    BIRTH_DATE,
    . AGE .,
    ROLE,
    { CONTACT },
    EMAIL ?
)

VENUE (
    _ ID _,
    NAME,
    ADDRESS ( STREET, STREET_NUMBER, FLOOR ?, LOCALITY, POSTAL_CODE )
)

EVENT (
    _ ID _,
    NAME,
    START_DATE,
    END_DATE
)

EMPLOYEE === N === < WORK_AT > === 1 === VENUE

EMPLOYEE --- 1 --- < MANAGE > === 1 === VENUE

EMPLOYEE ---- 1 ---- < SUPERVISE > --- N --- EMPLOYEE

VENUE --- N --- < HOSTS (START_DATE, END_DATE) > === M === EVENT
